// MCP-aware gateway log (APIM MCP servers: both setups): JSON-RPC methods, tools, clients and errors.
ApiManagementGatewayMCPLog
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| project TimeGenerated, McpServerEndpoint, Method, ToolName, ClientName, ClientVersion,
          AuthenticationMethod, TransportType, SessionId, ErrorType, Error, CorrelationId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
